## 教训
[Agent 应该怎么做来避免？]
```

#### modules/

**命名**：`MOD-{简短名}.md`。如 `MOD-AUTH.md`。

```markdown
---
id: MOD-xxx
object_type: module
lifecycle: knowledge
owner: architect
status: active
summary: "一句话描述此模块"
depends: [MOD-xxx, ADR-xxx]
language: python
framework: FastAPI
directory: src/auth/
features: [FEAT-AUTH, FEAT-LOGIN]
confidence: verified
---

